window, 8 months; $7,161 per multiple). Past results, not a forecast. This budget exceeds the published 4&times; size; we do not recommend raising the Multiplier beyond it &mdash; profit and drawdown rise together.</div><div class="ro-out ro-out-5"><span class="ro-flag ro-flag-rec">Fits at 4&times;</span> Fits at <b>4&times;</b> (the full published size). One multiple draws down <b>$2,036</b> at worst (best window); 4&times; uses about <b>$8,146</b> of a $50k budget. Expected average monthly profit at 4&times;: <b class="ro-ret">&asymp;$28,643</b> (best window, 8 months; $7,161 per multiple). Past results, not a forecast. This budget exceeds the published 4&times; size; we do not recommend raising the Multiplier beyond it &mdash; profit and drawdown rise together.</div></div>
